Ever angered your god?
Ever gotten the message your sacrifice seems "inadequate"?

Then this spoiler is for you!



For a neutral or lawful character the sacrifice "value" must be 
7 or more as calculated by mstrength.  For chaotic characters, 
the value must be 11 or more.  There is no point sacrificing 
corpses worth less than this.

And what monsters are worth 7/11 or more, you ask?



Here is a list of all monsters worth 7 or more (including those which
don't actually leave corpses).  Notable ones on this list are 
  kraken : 22 (easy to kill if you reverse genocide them away from water)
  baby dragons : 13 (easy to get by polymorph/egg laying)
  black puddings : 12 (easy to get if there's sink around)

